{"Title":"Order relative to authorizing the joint committee on Public Safety and Homeland Security to make an investigation and study of certain current Senate documents relative to firearms\r\n","BillNumber":"S2780","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J22","Name":"Joint Committee on Public Safety and Homeland Security","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J22","ResponseDate":"2024-05-08T13:17:31.17"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2780/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Order","Pinslip":"Senate, May 13, 2024 -- The committee on Public Safety and Homeland Security, to whom was referred the petitions (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1513) of Ryan C. Fattman for legislation to prohibit the confiscation of lawfully owned firearms during a state of emergency; (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1514) of Ryan C. Fattman for legislation to preserve second amendment rights for medical marijuana patients; (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1515) of Ryan C. Fattman for legislation relative to change of address for firearm licensing; and (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1516) of Ryan C. Fattman and Alyson M. Sullivan-Almeida for legislation relative to the lawful sale of ammunition, report the accompanying Order (Senate, No. 2780).","DocumentText":"\tOrdered, That the committee on Public Safety and Homeland Security be authorized and directed to make an investigation and study of certain current Senate documents numbered 1513, 1514, 1515, and 1516 relative to firearms.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Study","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J22","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J22"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Discharge to Another Committee","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J40","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J40"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}